{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"一、五年，春王正月，王使榮叔歸含且賵。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"含者何？口實也。其言歸含且賵何？兼之。兼之非禮也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"二、三月辛亥，葬我小君成風。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"成風者何？僖公之母也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"三、王使召伯來會葬。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"四、夏，公孫敖如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"五、秦人入鄀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚人滅六。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_101_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_101","textTraditional":"七、冬十月甲申，許男業卒。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}